==== SplatBloodOnNoDeath ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. Determines whether drops of blood will fall after hitting the target.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
SplatBloodOnNoDeath = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
